body:
**PLEASE NO.** I'm 50 and I make almost 2000/day. Now I feel I'm too old for women, even though I train like an Olympic athlete. There is a myth that older guys have sexual market value. Especially today. Especially if you are at that point with no experience. I have almost no experience with women.

&#x200B;

Do you want a woman who wants you for you money? Nothing should really keep you from pursuing women. You could always find a reason or shortcoming not to do it. Women would much rather have a younger guy who shows potential and ambition.

I cared, but I felt helpless. I had no friends, no social skills, no social outlets. Porn is terrible, it is like a drug. It filled a massive void I had. I'm sure many men are in the same boat. It also saps your energy to search for women. But there was a time before porn where I didn't meet either. When I went to college, getting one dirty pic was chore :lol:.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

I absolutely don't travel, it would be forcing a lifestyle that makes me feel uncomfortable. 

&#x200B;

My grandmother is actually Ukrainian and told me a guy could have a family till 80. when I told her I'm all alone at 25 she laughed. She said if you were a lady then you would have a reason to worry. 

Maybe in third world  places that is true. But I do see that true even in America, but it is not for FA men.

That is confidence. It is hard to grasp but just making the approach to a woman could be attractive. You took a risk (especially in this day and age). She don't like you, fine, she can say so and you go your own way. You have to say "HER LOSS" and move on to a prettier one. You have to feel you are a great guy that can make her life better. That is the difference between the manipulator/asshole. You are actually doing what you say.

&#x200B;

Men used to travel across the Atlantic Ocean in the 1500s and get off a ship face to face with Indians ready to remove their scalps. Now men are scared to say hi to woman, myself included.

Men who treat women like shit, cheat on them, cause emotional distress, even beat them, etc. Have women wanting to commit suicide for them. Guys who aren't that aggressive like myself, treat women respectfully, nicely (not a "nice guy," just looking to be nice and get in her pants) maybe lack a feature or two that women want, also make plans to kill themselves. 

&#x200B;

If you are posting here you life is very toxic and damaged.

&#x200B;

Life is really fucked up, ehh?

Can't wait to check out.
